MSR_PKG_CST_CONFIG_CONTROL (E2H, Table 2-35) read in each CPU sample on a model of the allow list, shown by
"thermal cpu <n> sample" as firmware_id (64FH[31:0]) and voltage_group (E2H[31:0]).  Applied by kbuild.sh only.

